@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Miria Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:おじさんは<br>レイアちゃんに言われて、<br>現場に残された痕跡を<br>探してたんだよね。|#0201Trial04_Miria001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Default,ArmR1,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Uncomfortable_Open01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Alisa Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:たしかに<br>コキ使われてたな。|#0201Trial04_Alisa001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Default,Angle01/Arms>Arms01,Angle01/Option_Arms>Option_Arms01_01,Angle01/Head/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Pensive_Open,Angle01/Head/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Closed
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:AnAn Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:『奴隷か？』|#0201Trial04_AnAn001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile1,ArmR6,ArmL5,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Closed02,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Smile_Middle
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Leia Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:良い指示を与えた<br>まとめ役がいたと<br>いうことだね！|#0201Trial04_Leia001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Default,ArmR2,ArmL5,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open01,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Smile_Middle
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Leia Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:それで、<br>調べた結果は<br>どうだったんだい？|#0201Trial04_Leia002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Miria.Default,ArmR9,ArmL1,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open04,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Smile_Open02
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Miria Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"現場の床は<br>一面が白い塗料で<br>塗り尽くされていて……<br>そして、メルルちゃんと<br>ヒロちゃんの足跡以外は<br><link=\"Objection_02_01_04_01\">残されていなかった</link>んだ。|#0201Trial04_Miria002|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Miria.Default,ArmR9,ArmL1,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open04,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Smile_Open02
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Miria Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"つまり部屋の中にいた<br>ヒロちゃん以外、<br>簡単に<br><link=\"Objection_02_01_04_02\">部屋に侵入</link>できた人は<br>いないんだよ。<br><link=\"Objection_02_01_04_03\">魔法</link>でも使ったわけじゃ<br>あるまいし……。|#0201Trial04_Miria003|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Default,ArmR6,ArmL5,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Closed02,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Smile_Middle
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Leia Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:そう……<br>よってヒロくんこそが<br>この事件の<br>犯人だったと<br>いうことさ！|#0201Trial04_Leia003| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4


